{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54526","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 十三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云气赤，那更满苍（京本作「青」）天。\n必定贼来侵我界，黑云中赤亦徒然，吾将必（京本作「莫」）迁延。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}